  "headline": "Mayfield set to return for vital Panthers clash",
  "summary": "NFL.com reports Tampa Bay quarterback Baker Mayfield is expected to start Sunday against Carolina after missing three games with a dislocated throwing thumb. Mayfield practised fully all week and coach Todd Bowles said he looked ready, though the Buccaneers officially list him as questionable and will be without Emeka Egbuka and Luke Goedeke.",
